---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import charging from "@/assets/images/portfolio/open-ear-headphones-charging.webp";
import commute from "@/assets/images/portfolio/open-ear-headphones-commute.webp";
import detail from "@/assets/images/portfolio/open-ear-headphones-detail.webp";
import hero from "@/assets/images/portfolio/open-ear-headphones-hero.webp";
import worn from "@/assets/images/portfolio/open-ear-headphones-worn.webp";
import PortfolioLayout from "@/layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro";
---

<PortfolioLayout title="开放式耳机：电商视觉交付包" description="以原创开放式耳机概念为例，展示主图、详情图、收纳图、佩戴图、场景图、裁切和 QA 的跨境电商视觉交付包。" ogImage={hero.src}>
	<header class="project-hero site-shell"><p class="project-kicker">P1 / P2 3C E-commerce Delivery</p><h1 class="project-title">开放式耳机：不是五张图，是一份商品交付包。</h1><p class="project-lead">将原创 3C 商品视觉按页面职责、裁切规格、质量门和文件交接重新组织。目标是让运营、详情页设计和后续视觉人员拿到可继续使用的图组，而不是从一批零散效果图重新判断。</p><div class="project-meta"><div><span class="meta-label">Scope</span><strong>3C 主图 / 详情页 / 场景</strong></div><div><span class="meta-label">Role</span><strong>产品锚点 / AIGC / QA</strong></div><div><span class="meta-label">Output</span><strong>5 图交付 / 模块映射</strong></div><div><span class="meta-label">Status</span><strong>原创概念 / 非真实上架</strong></div></div></header>

	<section class="site-shell case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Delivery Map</p><h2>一张图，只承担一个明确任务。</h2></div><div class="case-body"><p>交付图组先按电商页面职责编号，避免主图、结构图和场景图互相替代。图片中不生成价格、性能参数、认证或英文卖点；需要确认的商业文案由页面后置，避免将生成文字误写为产品事实。</p><div class="decision-table"><div class="decision-table__head"><span>文件</span><span>页面职责</span><span>放行检查</span></div><div><b>01_hero</b><span>第一屏商品识别：整套耳机、充电盒和结构轮廓。</span><span>主体完整、白底干净、左右耳成对、无伪造文字。</span></div><div><b>02_detail</b><span>详情页结构区：耳挂、触控面、声学区与材质关系。</span><span>形态仍为开放式耳挂，材质边界不漂移。</span></div><div><b>03_charge</b><span>收纳模块：开盖、内托、耳机与盒体的配对关系。</span><span>左右耳、盒体比例、开盖关系正确。</span></div><div><b>04_wear / 05_context</b><span>佩戴与通勤场景：解释位置与日常使用语境。</span><span>耳挂位置可信，产品仍可清晰辨认并保留文案留白。</span></div></div></div></section>

	<section class="site-shell case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Asset Set</p><h2>主图、结构、收纳与场景构成最小闭环。</h2></div><div class="case-body"><div class="detail-gallery"><figure><Image src={hero} alt="开放式耳挂耳机白底主图" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="eager" /><figcaption><b>01 / HERO</b><span>主图锚点：用于确认整套产品、颜色与基础轮廓。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><Image src={detail} alt="开放式耳挂耳机材质与结构细节图" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>02 / DETAIL</b><span>结构阅读：把耳挂、触控面和材质转折拆开。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><Image src={charging} alt="开放式耳挂耳机与充电盒收纳图" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>03 / CHARGE</b><span>收纳关系：先检查结构，后进入详情页排版。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><Image src={worn} alt="成年人佩戴开放式耳挂耳机的概念场景图" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>04 / WEAR</b><span>佩戴位置：确认开放式耳挂没有被生成成入耳式。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><Image src={commute} alt="开放式耳挂耳机通勤桌面概念图" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>05 / CONTEXT</b><span>场景模块：为后置信息保留留白，不代替性能证明。</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

	<section class="site-shell case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Handoff Notes</p><h2>把素材交给下一页，而不是交给猜测。</h2></div><div class="case-body"><div class="file-tree"><strong>open-ear-listing/</strong><br />├─ 01_anchor/ <span>hero 图、产品锚点与禁用项</span><br />├─ 02_pdp/ <span>detail / charge 结构模块</span><br />├─ 03_lifestyle/ <span>wear / context 场景模块</span><br />└─ 04_qa/ <span>结构、配对、裁切、文字后置检查</span></div><p style="margin-top:1.5rem">当前可交付的是原创概念图组、页面职责和 QA 口径。色彩变体、真实型号、参数、平台规则、合规文案和供应链资料不在本页编造，需由真实商品资料确认后再进入上架版本。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/open-ear-headphones/">查看完整商品视觉案例 <span>↗</span></a> <a class="text-link" href="/work/product-consistency/">查看跨图 QA 案例 <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</PortfolioLayout>
